  "method": [
    "Mix the dough as listed, following each ingredient's note (late additions, salt timing). Let it ferment 75–90 min.",
    "Pre-knead 45 pieces of dough of 450 g lightly round, then work them firmly round. Lightly dust with a mix of 75 % all-purpose and 25 % whole-wheat flour, place on the loading peel and let ferment briefly.",
